  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWith the new Settings UI being brought to the Quick Menu a few options which previously weren't in the Quick Menu Audio Tab are now in it.  \n\nI don't think most of these need to be in there as those usually don't need to be adjusted all the time and they just clutter the Menu.\n\n# Suggestion:  \n\nThe following settings should be removed from the Quick Menu Audio Tab:\n\n- Reset User Volume Overrides  \n\n- Mic Behavior  \n\n- Mic World Join Behavior   \n\nThese Settings aren't really changed often and they just clutter the Quick Menu Audio Tab\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a pictures showcasing the issue:",
